    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nVIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE BY REQUEST\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper are delighted to present No. 1 Bramble Row, Bansha Road, Tipperary Town, Co. Tipperary, E34 YT20 to the market.\n\nLOCATION\nThe property is situated on the Bansha Road, on the outskirts of Tipperary Town, with the town centre and its shops, supermarkets, schools, cafés, sporting facilities and everyday services all within easy reach. The nearby N24 provides convenient access to surrounding towns and cities, with Cashel approximately 19km, Cahir 22km, Clonmel 40km and Limerick City 40km away. Limerick Junction Train Station is approximately 4.4km from the property, providing regular rail connections to Limerick, Cork, Dublin and other destinations nationwide.\n\nDESCRIPTION\nThe property comprises a recently refurbished 3-bedroom semi-detached residence with accommodation arranged over two floors. At ground floor level, the accommodation comprises an Entrance Hall, Living Room, Kitchen / Dining Room and W.C. The First Floor contains 3 no. Bedrooms, Bathroom and Landing.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a private rear garden/patio area, providing a pleasant outdoor space. To the front, there is the additional benefit of off-street parking.\n\nAll mains services are connected, with heating provided by an oil-fired central heating system.\n\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 914 Sq.Ft. / 85 Sq.M.\n\nWith its convenient location, recently refurbished accommodation and just 750m to town centre, the property represents an attractive opportunity for First-Time Buyers, owner-occupiers, those looking to downsize or investors seeking a residential property within easy reach of Tipperary Town Centre.\n\nA virtual tour link can be supplied on request with actual viewings strictly by appointment. Further enquiries can be made by contacting Sole Selling Agents, Sherry FitzGerald Ryan Cooper in Tipperary Town on (062) 85161."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.45m x 1.77m\nWith tiled flooring and W.C\n\nLiving Room - 4.50m x 4.06m\nSpacious Living Room with duel access, Bay window and timber flooring\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.11m x 5.93m\nLarge Kitchen / Diningroom with a modern fitted kitchen, tiled flooring, sliding doors to rear Gadren and plumbed for washing machine\n\nW.C - 1.42m x 0.78m\nWith W.C, W.H.B and tiled flooring\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 2.99m x 2.06m\nWith timber flooring, Hot-Press and access to Attic\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.35m x 3.76m\nLarge rear facing Bedroom with timber flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.53m x 3.29m\nSpacious front facing Bedroom with timber flooring and fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.46m x 2.52m\nFront facing Bedroom with fitted storage and timber flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.96m x 2.06m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, electric shower and tiled floor to ceiling\n\n"
      },
